SUMMARY:The Friday Night Ultimate Pub Crawl! (with Live Band\, DJ and Danc
 ing)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\n**Kindly Read 
 Carefully:**\n\nWanna make some new friends in the best part of town?\n\nL
 et's start our weekend off right with a fun night out\, with good times\, 
 conversations and a couple cool clubs with Live Music\, DJ and Dancing.\n\
 nFirst we will meet at ***(La Carnita - (main floor to find us)*** to get 
 our evening going. (Conveniently located at Yonge & Eglinton\; 3-4 minute 
 walk east on Eglinton.\n\nThe next venue is only a few minutes away from t
 here (our Secret Location)\n\n**Where to Meet us?**\n**La Carnita - Good F
 ortune Bar-** You will be directed downstairs to there cool party room are
 a :)\n**Date:** Friday June 12th\n**Address:** 130 Eglinton Ave. Toronto\,
  ON M4P 2X9\n**Arrive between:** 7:00 pm and 9:30 pm (save a little money 
 if you come before 8:30 pm-plus more time to meet everyone :)\n\n**Highlig
 hts:**\n\\*Reserved tables and seating for dinner\, cocktails and mingling
 \n\\*Venue is very close to the Yonge and Eglinton subway station\n\\*Ice 
 breaker game to make it easy to meet and connect with everyone :)\n\\*A fu
 n game to win complimentary beverages and treats :)\n\\*Live Music (Band a
 nd DJ) with dancing at our second secret location\n\n\\*Dress casual or dr
 ess up if you like :)\n\n-Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can
  anticipate a fun night out.\n\n\\*One beverage or appetizer minimum at th
 e first and second location upon arrival. Thank you for your understanding
  and co-operation.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSteve Fl
 emming\n(Organizer)\nmeetup.com/soulcity/\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\nEvent Details:\n**The Friday Night Ultimate Pub Crawl (Live Band\
 , DJ and Dancing)**\n\n-We will meet ***on main floor\;*** connect with ev
 eryone\, ice breaker game\, socialize\, share some laughs\; then make our 
 way to our surprise location with live music\, cool atmosphere\, great peo
 ple and dancing :)\n\\*Plan to come for dinner too if you like at the firs
 t venue\, as tables will be reserved for everyone\n\\*Invite your friends 
 out too\n\n(2nd venue will be very close- walking distance for us)\n\n\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\n**EVENT FEE:**\n\n**Night of Event- Friday June 13th (Arrival T
 imes)**\n\n-10 dollars if you arrive between (7:00 pm to 8:30 pm)\n-15 dol
 lars if you arrive between (8:31 pm to 9:30 pm)\n\nIf you arrive after tha
 t you will simply miss the event as we will be heading off to the next ven
 ue at that time :)\n**\\*cash at the door**\n**or by e transfer in advance
  to:**\n**steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Parking Available:**\n\n\\*Plenty of
  free street parking on Eglinton and (Residential area south/east of venue
  for free)\n**Close to Subway Station:**\n\\*Also three minute walk east f
 rom Yonge/Eglinton subway station
