SUMMARY:Mix\, Mingle and Canada vs Qatar! (World Cup Soccer 2026)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nPlease join
  us for a great evening as we mix\, mingle and enjoy **Team Canada in Worl
 d Cup Soccer!**\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can ant
 icipate a fabulous turn out with lots of friendly peers to enjoy dinner an
 d the game\n\n**\\*Meet us inside Smoke Show between 6:00 pm and 7:30 pm**
 \n\n\\* The match starts at 6:00 pm\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\
 ,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**Mix\, Mingle a
 nd Canada vs Qatar! (World Cup Soccer 2026)**\n**Bonus:** Live Band after 
 the game too\n\n-A fun\, interactive\, event with friends\, food and the C
 anadian Men's World Cup Soccer match against Qatar (Lots of Big Screen TV'
 s to catch the game)\n-Pool Table\, and food specials too\n-Plenty of park
 ing all around the venue\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n-Arrive any time betw
 een 6:00 pm and 7:30 pm inside the restaurant (ask or look for Steve/Organ
 izer when you arrive)\n(1 minute walk from the new Eglinton station at Mt.
  Pleasant-or simply take bus or uber from the station)\n\n-Plenty of parki
 ng all around the venue and very close to Mt. Pleasant Station\n\n**Event 
 Fee:**\n5 dollars (cash only) when you arrive (HST is included)\nor e tran
 sfer in advance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://Steveflemming11@gmai
 l.com/)\n(One Beverage or Appetizer Minimum please to support the staff an
 d restaurant)\n\\*Plan to join us for dinner and the game!
