SUMMARY:Saturday Nature and Neighbourhood Walk! (Dinner Party\, Live Band\
 , Dancing)
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\n**\\*\\*Kindly
  Read Carefully\\*\\***\n\nPlease join me and my other groups for a fantas
 tic spring afternoon involving a leisure nature and beautiful neighbourhoo
 d walk\n\\- Includes different trails\\\, parks\\\, cafes\\\, ice breakers
 \\\, washroom breaks and beautiful sties to see\n-Our great event will con
 tinue as we hit a fabulous location for dinner\, beverages and conversatio
 n (optional)\n-Stick around after dinner for live disco band and Dancing (
 optional)\n\n**Time and Location: Where to meet us?**\nWe will meet at out
  front of **Smoke Show** **744 Mt. Pleasant Rd)**\n\\*Arrive early if you 
 like (however we will meet out front at\n**3:00 p.m. (we will wait for eve
 ryone to arrive until roughly 3:30 p.m.)**\n\nThis will give us an opportu
 nity to introduce ourselves as everyone arrives\; then make our way on our
  small adventure through quieter and more natural parts of the city we don
